@Focadu.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5282
@courseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@weeklyId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@dailyId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@activityId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@selectedOptionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@selectedRoleplayNodeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@curatedContentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

GET {{Focadu.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Focadu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/courses
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Focadu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/courses/{{courseId}}
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Focadu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/weeklies/{{weeklyId}}
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Focadu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dailies/{{dailyId}}
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Focadu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/today
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{Focadu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dailies/{{dailyId}}/start
Accept: application/json

###

### Quiz/WordMatch/Cloze(MultipleChoice): Score sempre calculado no servidor a partir de selectedOptionId.
POST {{Focadu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dailies/{{dailyId}}/activities/{{activityId}}/responses
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "selectedOptionId": "{{selectedOptionId}}"
}

###

### Cloze(FreeText): transcript comparado no servidor contra ExpectedAnswer; justification so armazenada.
POST {{Focadu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dailies/{{dailyId}}/activities/{{activityId}}/responses
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "transcript": "console.log(x)",
  "justification": "Porque queremos imprimir o valor de x no console."
}

###

### Roleplay: node terminal alcancado ao percorrer o dialogo (IsTerminal = true).
POST {{Focadu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dailies/{{dailyId}}/activities/{{activityId}}/responses
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "selectedRoleplayNodeId": "{{selectedRoleplayNodeId}}"
}

###

POST {{Focadu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dailies/{{dailyId}}/complete
Accept: application/json

###

### Autoria de conteudo curado ----------------------------------------------------------------

POST {{Focadu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/curated-content
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "weeklyId": "{{weeklyId}}",
  "type": "Reading",
  "title": "Novo artigo da semana",
  "externalUrl": "https://example.com/artigo"
}

###

PUT {{Focadu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/curated-content/{{curatedContentId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Como a web funciona",
  "externalUrl": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Getting_started/Web_standards/How_the_web_works",
  "bodyText": "Texto completo curado vai aqui."
}

###
